      "section": "墓库诗诀",
      "text": "墓库诗诀",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c275:p0001",
      "sha256": "fb08e034349b155cc36c98dd6d532211e7b2ba4745c91c6ac8ab603e81634559"
    },
    {
      "section": "墓库诗诀",
      "text": "墓库元来是葬神，一为正印细推论，相生相顺无相克，富贵之中次第分。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c275:p0002",
      "sha256": "bbc85e14fdaba2707581ed150f0905c824d7bb4ab0359683174f6b179582cd48"
    },
    {
      "section": "墓库诗诀",
      "text": "人命若还逢墓库，积谷堆财难计数，悭贪不使一文钱，至老人呼守钱奴。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c275:p0003",
      "sha256": "ce3ff68fde6919cc01748a0cd80a801607b1bc266607859ebaa69798343922ef"
    },
    {
      "section": "墓库诗诀",
      "text": "眉批：墓库死者，埋葬于地，五行至此亦如是，如财官印於早有闭而不须用刑冲取用其财者。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 41,
          "layer": "historical_commentary",
          "marker": "眉批：",
          "boundary_closed": true
        }
      ],
